    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are the target of an energy ranged weapon attack</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're aware of the attack, are not @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} to it, and are in your spotlight.</p><hr><p>Your spotlight hardens into a prism moments before the attack hits. You gain a +4 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the attack misses, make a ranged Strike that deals @Damage[(floor(@actor.level/2))d6[untyped]] damage of the same type as the triggering attack with a range of 120 feet. This damage increases by an additional die at level 14 and every 2 levels thereafter.</p>",
